From a9262d0cbb659f92d96ec5fda10c473bba5312e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:52:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: add Protective Load Balancing
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add Protective Load Balancing: the per-connection PLB state machine,
the per-net sysctls (tcp_plb_*), and the ECN_LOW routing feature that
marks packets eligible for rerouting on congestion.

BBRv3 drives PLB; the PLB patch itself does not depend on BBRv3.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

Origin: WildKernels 5.10 BBRv3 backport, original from Google bbr-v3-2024-02-22-01 (fatalcoder524)（本补丁：PLB 核心与 per-net sysctl）
Upstream-Status: Backport
KABI: none
Depends-On: previous tcp_rate infrastructure patch
Tested-On: yudi 5.10.272（r2 构建与开机）, 2026-10-29
---
